61: ### Product Guides\nL62: \nL63:   * cite32†Knowledge L64:   * cite33†Skills L65:   * cite34†Plugins L66:   * cite35†Set up your plugin ecosystem L67:   * cite36†Session Insights L68:   * cite37†Secrets & Site Cookies L69:   * cite38†Security Profiles L70:   * cite39†Cloud Authentication with OIDC L71:   * cite40†Creating Playbooks L72:   * cite41†Using Playbooks L73:   * cite42†Automations L74:   * cite43†Auto-triage L75:   * cite44†Scheduled Sessions L76:   * cite45†Deployments L77:   * cite46†Autofix Settings - Bot Comments L78:   * cite47†Invite your Team L79: ### Integrations\nL80: \nL81:   * cite48†Integrations Overview L82:   * cite49†Slack L83:   * cite50†Microsoft Teams L84:   * cite51†GitHub L85:   * cite52†GitLab L86:   * cite53†Bitbucket L87:   * cite54†Linear L88:   * cite55†Jira L89:   * cite56†PagerDuty L90:   * cite57†GitHub Pull Request Templates L91:   * cite58†Self-Hosted SCM & Artifacts L92: \nL93: ### Admin\nL94: \nL95:   * cite59†Security at Cognition L96:   * Billing\nL97: \nL98:   * cite60†Common Issues L99: \nL100: ### Release Notes\nL101: \nL102:   * cite61†Recent Updates L103:   * cite62†2026 L104:   * cite63†2025 L105:   * cite64†2024 L106: \nL107: Working with Devin\nL108: # Devin voice mode\nL109: \nL110: Use Devin voice mode to talk through ideas, pressure-test an approach, and hand off work. Learn how to start and control a call.\nL111: \nL112: Copy page Copy page\nL113: \nL114: With voice mode, you can talk naturally with Devin to explore ideas, pressure-test approaches, and hand off work while you’re away from your keyboard.\nL115: ##\nL116: \nL117: cite65†​ L118: \nL119: Start a call\nL120: \nL121: Click the voice call button beside the message box on the home page in Agent mode or in an existing session, then allow microphone access. Any message you’ve typed is sent when you start the call.\nL122: \nL123: cite66†Image: Devin message box with the pointer over the waveform icon and the Start voice call tooltip visible.†mintcdn.com L124: \nL125: Hover over the waveform icon to see “Start voice call.”\nL126: ##\nL127: \nL128: cite67†​ L129: \nL130: During a call\nL131: \nL132:   * Mute microphone pauses your microphone. Click Unmute microphone to speak again.\nL133:   * Hold Space to talk while muted when you’re not typing.\nL134:   * Silence Devin turns off Devin’s audio without muting your microphone. Click Unsilence Devin to hear Devin again.\nL135:   * End voice call hangs up.\nL136: You can navigate within Devin while the call stays connected. Your conversation appears in the session history.\nL137: ##\nL138: \nL139: cite68†​ L140: \nL141: Tips\nL142: \nL143:   * Don’t be afraid to interrupt Devin’s work, ask questions and clarify your thoughts as you have them.\nL144:   * Feel free to interrupt Devin while it is talking.\nL145:   * If you have preferences for how Devin should speak (e.g. speak faster or slower, communication style) just ask!\nL146: \nL147: cite15†Devin Session Tools cite17†Computer Use L148: \nL149: cite69†linkedin†www.linkedin.com cite70†x†x.com L150: \nL151: cite71†Powered byThis documentation is built and hosted on Mintlify, a developer documentation platform†www.mintlify.com --------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nGrok Bot Hooks Salesforce, HubSpot, and Gong for Sales Teams | TeslaNorth.com (https://teslanorth.com/2026/09/11/grok-bot-salesforce-hubspot-sales/)\nciteturn784view1 [wordlim: 200] Crawled: today; Content type: text/html; Source: open({\"ref_id\":\"turn783view3\",\"lineno\":40}); Total lines: 183\nL0: [Input: Search …]\nL1: \nL2:   * cite0†Deals L3:   * cite1†Reviews L4:   * Email us (tips@teslanorth.com)\nL5: \nL6:   * cite2†Latest News L7:   * cite3†Tesla L8:   * cite4†SpaceX L9:   * cite5†Software Updates L10:   * cite2†Latest News L11:   * cite0†Deals L12:   *